WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A streaming path: Pub/Sub to Dataflow to BigQuery.

00:03.000 --> 00:04.500
Four steps in a row: publisher, topic, job and table.

00:04.500 --> 00:08.000
Publishers send events to a Pub/Sub topic.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.600
Dataflow pulls the events and transforms each one.

00:11.600 --> 00:16.700
Rows are written to BigQuery and the result starts to grow.

00:16.700 --> 00:21.800
Dataflow acknowledges each message, so Pub/Sub does not send it again.

00:21.800 --> 00:27.400
Pub/Sub holds events until they are acknowledged. Dataflow processes them and BigQuery stores the result.
